    "treatment_summary": {
     "value": "continuous infusion aztreonam (260 mg/h, then 350 mg/h [8.4 g/day] for more than eight months); tobramycin, ciprofloxacin and vancomycin; nebulized colistin, intravenous polymyxin B and azithromycin; donor granulocyte infusions; multiple cultured epidermal autograft (Epicel) skin grafts",
     "span": [
      "this infusion was reinitiated at 260 mg/h on 11/26",
      "aztreonam was held and then resumed on 12/1 at 350 mg/h (8.4 g/day) and continued for more than eight months thereafter",
      "Traditional dosing of tobramycin was changed to tobramycin 270 mg (5 mg/kg) IV every 24h, and ciprofloxacin (11/19 to 12/1) and vancomycin were also continued. In addition, nebulized colistin (11/26 to 12/13), intravenous polymyxin B (11/26 to 12/1), and azithromycin were initiated for resistant or atypical pneumonia.",
      "Donor granulocyte infusions were started on 11/27 and continued until 7/16.",
      "he received multiple cultured epidermal autograft (Epicel®) skin grafts"
